Challenge to the impugned rule to the extent it provides for levy of additional fee for delay in applying for renewal after expiry of validity period of certificate of fitness of motor vehicle is under challenge in present petitions on the ground of failure to conform to the statute under which it is made or that it exceeds the limits of authority conferred by the enabling Act, i.e., the Act of 1988.
